{{Shintoism}} <!-- Inari shrines are to be included in this list - no need to make a separate page for them. --> This is a '''list of notable [[Shinto shrine]]s''' in [[Japan]]. There are tens of thousands of shrines in [[Japan]]. Shrines with structures that are [[National Treasures of Japan]] are covered by the [[List of National Treasures of Japan (shrines)]]. For Shinto shrines in other countries, scroll down to the [[#See also|See also]] section.
Shinto shrines from specific sects or new churches are not included in this list.
