{{Short description|none}} {{Shintoism}}
This is a '''list of notable [[Shinto shrine]]s''' in [[:en:Japan|Japan]]. There are tens of thousands of shrines in [[:en:Japan|Japan]]. Shrines with structures that are [[National Treasures of Japan]] are covered by the [[List of National Treasures of Japan (shrines)]]. For Shinto shrines in other countries, scroll down to the [[#See also|See also]] section.
This list includes all [[Beppyo Shrine]]s and provincial [[Sōja shrine|Sōja Shrines]] and [[Ichinomiya]]
Shinto shrines from specific sects or new churches are not included in this list.
